  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      314.57,
      401.89,
      339.71
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Economic Service Charge(Amendment) Act, No. of 2020.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      355.97,
      401.89,
      450.11
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 2 of the Economic Service Charge Act, No.13 of 2006 is hereby amended in subsection (1) by thesubstitution for the words \u201cbe charged from every person andevery partnership for every quarter of every year ofassessment\u201d, of the words and figures \u201cbe charged from everyperson and every partnership for every quarter of every yearof assessment prior to January 1, 2020 \u2014\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      463.37,
      401.9,
      486.71
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
